       Shorten ~ expd .  (Revised by Wolf Lammen, 28-Jul-2022.) $)
    expdcom $p |- ( ps -> ( ch -> ( ph -> th ) ) ) $=
      ( wi wa com12 ex ) BCADFABCGDEHI $.

    $( Exportation deduction.  (Contributed by NM, 20-Aug-1993.)  (Proof
