  imimorb $p |- ( ( ( ps -> ch ) -> ( ph -> ch ) ) <->
                  ( ph -> ( ps \/ ch ) ) ) $=
    ( wi wo bi2.04 dfor2 imbi2i bitr4i ) BCDZACDDAJCDZDABCEZDJACFLKABCGHI $.

  $( Absorption of disjunction into equivalence.  (Contributed by NM,
