     3-Jan-2005.) $)
  pm4.77 $p |- ( ( ( ps -> ph ) /\ ( ch -> ph ) ) <->
                ( ( ps \/ ch ) -> ph ) ) $=
    ( wo wi wa jaob bicomi ) BCDAEBAECAEFBACGH $.

  $( Theorem *3.48 of [WhiteheadRussell] p. 114.  (Contributed by NM,
