    wi anor anbi2i 3bitrri ) CABEFZCEZACEZGZUCACFCDEZFEFZEZGUCFUHFEFCCUBAGZEUIC
    EUEUICUBAFRUIFABHUBAIJKCUILUBACMNUDUHUCCUGACCUFGUGCDOCUFSPQTUCUHSUA $.

  $( A closed form of ~ mpbir , analogous to ~ pm2.27 (assertion).
