       by BJ, 25-Dec-2020.)  (Proof shortened by Wolf Lammen, 3-Sep-2023.) $)
    dfsb7 $p |- ( [ t / x ] ph <-> E. y ( y = t /\ E. x ( x = y /\ ph ) ) ) $=
