  ${
    hbimd.1 $e |- ( ph -> A. x ph ) $.
    hbimd.2 $e |- ( ph -> ( ps -> A. x ps ) ) $.
    hbimd.3 $e |- ( ph -> ( ch -> A. x ch ) ) $.
    $( Deduction form of bound-variable hypothesis builder ~ hbim .
