  ${
    hb.1 $e |- ( ph -> A. x ph ) $.
    hb.2 $e |- ( ps -> A. x ps ) $.
    $( If ` x ` is not free in ` ph ` and ` ps ` , it is not free in
       ` ( ph /\ ps ) ` .  (Contributed by NM, 14-May-1993.)  (Proof shortened
