    sblbis $p |- ( [ y / x ] ( ch <-> ph ) <-> ( [ y / x ] ch <-> ps ) ) $=
      ( wb wsb sbbi bibi2i bitri ) CAGDEHCDEHZADEHZGLBGCADEIMBLFJK $.
  $}

  ${
    sbrbis.1 $e |- ( [ y / x ] ph <-> ps ) $.
    $( Introduce right biconditional inside of a substitution.  (Contributed by
