    sbrbis $p |- ( [ y / x ] ( ph <-> ch ) <-> ( ps <-> [ y / x ] ch ) ) $=
      ( wb wsb sbbi bibi1i bitri ) ACGDEHADEHZCDEHZGBMGACDEILBMFJK $.
  $}

  ${
    sbrbif.1 $e |- F/ x ch $.
    sbrbif.2 $e |- ( [ y / x ] ph <-> ps ) $.
    $( Introduce right biconditional inside of a substitution.  (Contributed by
