       (Revised by Wolf Lammen, 16-Oct-2021.) $)
    nfex $p |- F/ x E. y ph $=
      ( wex wn wal df-ex nfn nfal nfxfr ) ACEAFZCGZFBACHMBLBCABDIJIK $.
  $}

  ${
    hbex.1 $e |- ( ph -> A. x ph ) $.
    $( If ` x ` is not free in ` ph ` , then it is not free in ` E. y ph ` .
