       Added precisions on axiom usage.  (Revised by BJ, 27-Sep-2022.)
       (Proof modification is discouraged.)  (New usage is discouraged.) $)
    dariiALT $p |- E. x ( ch /\ ps ) $=
      ( wa wi spi anim2i eximii ) CAGCBGDFABCABHDEIJK $.
