    $( Existence premise for Celaront, e.g., "Snakes exist". $)
    celaront.e $e |- E. x ch $.
    $( "Celaront", one of the syllogisms of Aristotelian logic.  No ` ph ` is
       ` ps ` , all ` ch ` is ` ph ` , and some ` ch ` exist, therefore some
